WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.087
Identify, explain and apply the important ideas behind protecting private

00:00:05.087 --> 00:00:05.576
information.

00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:11.360
Personal information: includes home address and passwords. Password: is a private

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:12.253
account secret.

00:00:13.117 --> 00:00:18.481
Phishing: is a trick to obtain private details. Two-step verification: adds another

00:00:18.481 --> 00:00:22.951
account-protection check. Trusted adult: helps children decide what to share.

00:00:23.783 --> 00:00:28.718
Use an imaginary example or a teacher-approved offline screenshot. Discuss when to

00:00:28.718 --> 00:00:34.064
use personal information and password. Never enter a real password or share private

00:00:34.064 --> 00:00:35.709
details in this activity.
